rentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D707\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D707\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(636,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the permeability of free space, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.729ex\" height=\"1.538ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -680 764 680\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the electric field strength, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.717ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 759 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the magnetic field strength.</p>\n<p>In an electromagnetic wave, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.729ex\" height=\"1.538ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -680 764 680\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.717ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 759 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are related by the equation:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.442ex\" height=\"1.57ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 3289.6 694\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1041.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2097.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2530.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.98ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 433 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the speed of light in vacuum. </p>\n<p>Substituting this into the energy density equations gives:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.003ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 6631.4 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1473,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2528.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3322.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4224.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4613.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5046.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(5805.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(422,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>and</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.126ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.877ex\" height=\"3.083ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 5249.4 1362.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1469.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2525.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(587.5,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D707\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D707\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(636,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g><rect width=\"1288.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(4053.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(792,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.334ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.464ex\" height=\"3.291ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4183 1454.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(710.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1766.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1031.4,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(220,-367.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,-132.1)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D700\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D700\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(499,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(902.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D707\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D707\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(636,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g><rect width=\"1942.1\" height=\"42.4\" x=\"853\" y=\"625.5\"></rect></g><rect width=\"2176.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, we can rewrite <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.704ex\" height=\"1.339ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 1195.2 592\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> as:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.126ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18.593ex\" height=\"3.083ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 8218.2 1362.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1473,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2528.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3322.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(410.8,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D707\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D707\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(636,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"935.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(4497.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(792,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5970.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(7026.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D462\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D462\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(605,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the ratio of the average electric energy density to the average magnetic energy density is 1. </p>\n","qKey":"1lh25dl4z","paperKey":"jee-main-2023-online-6th-april-morning-shift","exam":"jee-main"}]}